"overview":"Ben Chase is an on-the-rise Boston attorney currently defending a wealthy client in a high-profile murder case. Martin Thiel is the wealthy young man on trial for a particularly brutal murder. The verdict sets Thiel free. Within 24 hours another grizzly and all-too-familiar murder has taken place with striking similarities to the first crime. Chase inexplicably agrees to act as his defense attorney; but this time it will be to gather evidence that will put away his client for good."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pdPo5BKZBHZ8oPjkJfo2fXLTQvH.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9yNWi2G5c0CkbsqiTWUhAj41CGa.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":41952,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pdPo5BKZBHZ8oPjkJfo2fXLTQvH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pdPo5BKZBHZ8oPjkJfo2fXLTQvH.jpg","language":"it","width":1600,"height":2400},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pdPo5BKZBHZ8oPjkJfo2fXLTQvH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pdPo5BKZBHZ8oPjkJfo2fXLTQvH.jpg","language":"it","width":1600,"height":2400}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r5cPgWYrJtXBzJZuPmzhlYrEmrV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r5cPgWYrJtXBzJZuPmzhlYrEmrV.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r5cPgWYrJtXBzJZuPmzhlYrEmrV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r5cPgWYrJtXBzJZuPmzhlYrEmrV.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/31cV6AtHGjZDLgHEzLLgZTQnjrx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/31cV6AtHGjZDLgHEz